        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Twin screw extruders have two screws, which have more shear and mixing capability than the single screw in a singel screw extruder. Depending on the direction of rotation of the screws, a distinction is made between counter-rotating and co-rotating twin-screw extruders.</obo:IAO_0000115>
