        <obo:IAO_0000114 rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000124"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>ml1+1 is the quality Mooney Viscosity which is the torque at t=1 min. after the start of the Mooney test.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dc:contributor>Pallavi Karanth</dc:contributor>
